      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――却仿佛被无形之力挽留一般……\n请原谅我这颗难以抑制的澎湃悸动之心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a99b7d19018f79a3c834eec17ebf91e342326ded4080b6f53bf4c837a320407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
