      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看完『日本杯』之后……\n迷人景致的眼里――闪烁着决意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58140ae0a6c418c2c552ed062d21cc2ed9b7f8d388839bf6021f4dd1f323f53b",
