      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小特前辈和伏特加酱。\n她们展现的绝景虽然截然不同……\n却又有些相似。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93e8def23efaefc662e8df1cb8272f5086461f3473deb960dbdf441cf778dac",
