      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想在这里展现『秋华赏』时大家寄予我的\n……不、是超越那些心意的景色",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2de3270d389b40e25e1d0af8435845efc4e60a2a78a66d4ff63d380a1ef004b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
