      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众多GⅠ赛马娘同场竞技、\n包括红色梦想在内的新锐赛马娘也在奋力奔跑、\n其中脱颖而出的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d34109b516eed7692a69d4c750dd51e14bf30e6fa0e4b06a8fe94d585b674c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
